Package: rgeopl
Type: Package
Title: Unified Access to Polish National Geodata (GUGiK and BDL)
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Igor", family = "Pawelec", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "gorasz44@gmail.com")
Description: Search and download spatial data from the Polish national geodetic
    resource (GUGiK / PZGiK) and the Forest Data Bank (BDL, Lasy Panstwowe),
    selected by an area of interest. Handles server-side record limits by
    transparent pagination, keeps archival vintages as a queryable attribute,
    and caches both index responses and downloaded files on disk.
URL: https://github.com/igorpawelec/rgeopl,
    https://igorpawelec.github.io/rgeopl/
BugReports: https://github.com/igorpawelec/rgeopl/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite,
    rlang,
    sf,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils,
    xml2
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    terra,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
